#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 気にしてもしょうがない、放っておこう。
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There's not much point in worrying about it now. I\n"
"should try to just forget about it..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. きっと今も、この向こうで…黒幕が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even now, the mastermind is probably on the other side\n"
"of that surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう思うとムカツクけど、放っておくしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just thinking about it puts me on edge...but there's\n"
"nothing I can really do about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最近、あんまり時計を見なくなった。
#. 意味がないってわかったからかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't look at the clock too much these days. I mean,\n"
"what's the point?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これも慣れってヤツか、
#. なんだか虚しいな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess this is me getting used to being here, huh?\n"
"It's a pretty empty feeling...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本来の教室なら窓があるべき場所…
#. だが、そこにはやっぱり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In any normal classroom, this is where a window would\n"
"be. But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鉄板のような物が打ち付けられていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...there's some kind of huge metal plate mounted over\n"
"it now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本来の教室なら窓があるべき場所…
#. だが、そこにはやっぱり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In any normal classroom, this is where a window would\n"
"be. But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鉄板のような物が打ち付けられていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...there's some kind of huge metal plate mounted over\n"
"it now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

